  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed L-shaped dormer, by virtue of its scale and siting, would be a visually overbearing addition that dominates the rear roof slope and lacks any sense of subservience to the host dwelling. This is considered harmful to the overall character and appearance of the property and the wider terrace row and is therefore contrary to the design objectives of Policy 53 of the adopted Waltham Forest Local Plan LP1 (2024).&lt;/p&gt;"
